---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#101310" /><title>Thanks for getting in touch — BF GYM</title><link rel="icon" href="/bf-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></head>
<body><main><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/">BF<span>.</span> GYM</a><p class="eyebrow">ENQUIRY RECEIVED</p><h1>THANK YOU<span>.</span></h1><p>Thanks for reaching out about fitness coaching. Your enquiry has been submitted. We'll be in touch using the email you provided.</p><a class="button" href="/">BACK TO BF GYM ↗</a></div></main><footer>© {year} BF GYM</footer></body>
</html>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#101310;color:#f2f3e9;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}main{display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:92vh;padding:30px}.wrap{width:min(620px,100%)}.brand{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.brand span,h1 span{color:#c7ff52}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;color:#c7ff52;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2em;margin-top:100px}h1{font:800 clamp(62px,12vw,110px)/1 Impact,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:16px 0}p:not(.eyebrow){color:#b2bbac;line-height:1.8;max-width:500px}.button{display:inline-block;background:#c7ff52;color:#101310;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;padding:19px 23px;margin-top:24px}footer{text-align:center;color:#90988c;font-size:11px;padding:16px}
</style>